# TR Necrom: "A Missing Scout" (TR_m2_Nm_Scout). Terlesi Othralas in the Hall of Contemplation asks after the Temple
# scout Doril Indanyon ("gone missing": "I will help you." 1: 10). His body lies in Ashpibishal's Inner Shrine;
# searching it logs 20 (TR_m2_q_A9_3_DorilScript). With the heretic Vendrin Silvasan dead, Terlesi pays at once (30,
# 500 drakes).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel, the kill for the fight. Refs carry TR_Mainland's slot 09: 09ADB385 Doril,
# 09CEA1E9 Vendrin.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_nm_vorith_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case nm_scout_start
run
player->PositionCell 1146 -3620 1365 0 "Necrom, Hall of Contemplation"
until 600 "TR_m2_Terlesi Othralas"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Terlesi Othralas
ask gone missing
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Scout == 10
bye
end

case nm_scout_shrine
run
player->PositionCell 4029 3120 11660 0 "Ashpibishal, Inner Shrine"
until 600 "TR_m2_Vendrin Silvasan"->GetDistance player < 1000
wait 150
console 09CEA1E9.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "TR_m2_Vendrin Silvasan" >= 1
run
player->PositionCell 5441 5720 10915 0 "Ashpibishal, Inner Shrine"
wait 60
activate 09ADB385
close ContainerMenu
until 300 GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Scout >= 20
end

case nm_scout_done
run
player->PositionCell 1146 -3620 1365 0 "Necrom, Hall of Contemplation"
until 600 "TR_m2_Terlesi Othralas"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Terlesi Othralas
ask gone missing
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Scout == 30
bye
end
